2019s new in this version\n\n\u2022 Added barcode decoding alongside QR codes (supports common 1D/2D formats).\n\n\u2022 Fixed issue where scanning would fail or delay on first app open\u2014now scans immediately.\n\n\u2022 Introduced history: all decoded QR codes and barcodes are saved.\n\n             \u2022 View past scans.\n\n             \u2022 Delete individual entries or clear all history.\n\n\u2022 Improved reliability of URL detection and copy-to-clipboard flows.", "created_date": 1754410657, "id": "25209516951970459", "version": "0.1.1", "version_code": 3, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24677807858474707", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25209516951970459"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1365386561241795"}]}, "change_log": "What\u2019s new in this version\n\n\u2022 Added barcode decoding alongside QR codes (supports common 1D/2D formats).\n\n\u2022 Fixed issue where scanning would fail or delay on first app open\u2014now scans immediately.\n\n\u2022 Introduced history: all decoded QR codes and barcodes are saved.\n\n             \u2022 View past scans.\n\n             \u2022 Delete individual entries or clear all history.\n\n\u2022 Improved reliability of URL detection and copy-to-clipboard flows.", "created_date": 1753976543, "id": "25166782062910615", "version": "0.1.1", "version_code": 2, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBin